VDMOS RD RS channel and flicker noise (#1348)
VDD vdd 0 DC 10
Vgate gate 0 DC 3 AC 1
Rload vdd out 10
M1 out gate 0 power
.model power VDMOS (VTO=1 KP=0.1 LAMBDA=0.02 RD=0.2 RS=0.3 RG=1 RB=1 KF=1e-20 AF=1.2)
.noise v(out) Vgate dec 1 1 1meg 1
.control
run
setplot noise1
set numdgt=16
print all
.endc
.end
